l be provided in your written quotation before confirmation.","is_active":true,"sort_order":610},{"slug":"multi-ziyarat-india","category":"domestic","name":"Multi-Ziyarat India","duration":"6 Days / 5 Nights","price_per_adult":29999,"pricing_mode":"starting","price_basis":"Per adult; room sharing confirmed in quotation","pricing_note":"Prices vary with travel dates, airline, hotel availability, room sharing, visa requirements and season. Final price is confirmed in your written quotation before booking.","collection":"ziyarat","places":"Delhi → Ajmer → Jaipur → Agra","tagline":"Muslim-friendly India","description":"Explore Delhi → Ajmer → Jaipur → Agra with a journey planned around your family, travel dates and preferred pace. Exact services and arrangements are confirmed in your written quotation.","image_url":null,"highlights":["Multi-city ziyarat and heritage itinerary planning"],"inclusions":["Multi-city ziyarat and heritage itinerary planning"],"exclusions":["Personal expenses and shopping","Room upgrades and private transport unless listed","Extra baggage and optional activities","Services not listed in your written quotation","Meals, flights and visas unless explicitly listed"],"itinerary":[["Delhi","Begin your journey in Delhi. Activities, nights and transfers follow the final agreed itinerary."],["Ajmer","Continue your journey in Ajmer. Activities, nights and transfers follow the final agreed itinerary."],["Jaipur","Continue your journey in Jaipur. Activities, nights and transfers follow the final agreed itinerary."],["Agra","Continue your journey in Agra. Activities, nights and transfers follow the final agreed itinerary."]],"cancellation_terms":"Deposit, payment schedule, supplier cancellation charges and refund terms will be provided in your written quotation before confirmation.","is_active":true,"sort_order":620}]$catalogue$::jsonb) as packages(
  slug text,
  category text,
  name text,
  duration text,
  price_per_adult numeric,
  pricing_mode text,
  price_basis text,
  pricing_note text,
  collection text,
  places text,
  tagline text,
  description text,
  image_url text,
  highlights text[],
  inclusions text[],
  exclusions text[],
  itinerary jsonb,
  cancellation_terms text,
